<%# The landing page, rebuilt against the "Landing page, desktop" board.

    Four things the board draws are not here, each because the app cannot stand
    behind them:

      - a Distance select on the hero search. There is no distance anywhere in
        the data. Removed from Shared::SearchBarComponent too, see that file
      - trial counts on the condition cards, 820 / 640 / 410 and so on. Invented,
        and impossible: ClinicalTrialClient#parse_response sets total_count to
        the length of the page it just fetched
      - condition categories. The conditions table has a name and nothing else,
        so Cancer / Neurology / Respiratory is a grouping that does not exist.
        All of them are listed instead, which is also how somebody with lupus
        finds lupus rather than guessing which card it lives under
      - "Now indexing studies in all 50 states". Nothing is indexed; every search
        is a live query to the registry

    Photographs are the brand's own shapes instead. Ten slots across this page
    and the stories need licensed or consented images, and patient photos need
    consent in writing. The page had been filling them from picsum.photos, a
    third-party placeholder service that returns whatever it likes: an onion, a
    footbridge and a mountain range were on screen when this was rebuilt. %>

<% content_for :title, "Dira Health - Find clinical trials that match you" %>

<section id="hero" class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-line dark:border-line-on-dark
                          bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#EDF2FB_0%,#F6F9FD_52%,#FFFFFF_100%)]
                          dark:bg-none dark:bg-surface-on-dark">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="hidden md:block dark:hidden">
    <%= render "shared/panel_backdrop", id: "hero", view_box: "0 0 1440 620",
          blob_x: 1250, blob_y: 90, blob_r: 240,
          pill_y: 210, pill_w: 260, pill_h: 340,
          dots_x: 1060, dots_y: 400, dot_x: 140, dot_y: 120 %>
  </div>

  <div class="relative <%= Layout::PageWidth::CONTAINER %> py-20 lg:py-28 flex flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center">
    <h1 class="font-primary max-w-4xl text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.04] text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark">
      Where patients find trials worth their time
    </h1>
    <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark">
      Search recruiting clinical trials by condition and location. Every result shows why you match
      and what the study asks of you.
    </p>

    <div class="w-full max-w-4xl mt-2 text-left">
      <%= render Shared::SearchBarComponent.new(
            url: search_index_path,
            variant: :full,
            conditions: @conditions
          ) %>
    </div>

    <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark">
      <span class="text-good dark:text-good-on-dark">
        <%= render Utilities::IconComponent.new("check_circle", size: 4) %>
      </span>
      No account needed to search
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<%# Browse by condition. Every pill is a real search, which is the whole reason
    this replaced the board's six category cards. %>
<section id="conditions" class="border-b border-line dark:border-line-on-dark bg-surface dark:bg-surface-on-dark">
  <div class="<%= Layout::PageWidth::CONTAINER %> py-16 lg:py-20 flex flex-col gap-8">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">Browse by condition</p>
        <h2 class="font-primary text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark">
          Start where your diagnosis starts
        </h2>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark">
          Pick the one that fits, then narrow by location on the results page.
        </p>
      </div>
      <%= render Buttons::ButtonComponent.new(
            path: search_index_path, text: "Search by anything else", color: "secondary",
            icon: "arrow_right", icon_position: "right"
          ) %>
    </div>

    <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <% @conditions.each do |condition| %>
        <li>
          <%= render Shared::PillComponent.new(
                text: condition.name,
                path: search_index_path(condition: condition.name)
              ) %>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>

    <%# Said plainly rather than implied by a count nobody can produce. %>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark">
      <%= pluralize(@conditions.size, "condition") %> to start from. The search box above takes anything
      the registry recognises, so a condition missing from this list is still worth searching for.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<%# How it works. Three steps, and each one describes something the app does. %>
<section id="how-it-works" class="border-b border-line dark:border-line-on-dark bg-paper dark:bg-paper-on-dark">
  <div class="<%= Layout::PageWidth::CONTAINER %> py-16 lg:py-20 flex flex-col gap-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="font-primary text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark">
        Your clinical trial journey, simplified
      </h2>
    </div>

    <ol class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <% [
           ["search", "Search across every study",
            "One search over the public registry, filtered to studies that are open. No account needed."],
           ["badge_check", "See why you match",
            "With a profile, every study carries a score that opens to the criteria behind it, including the ones you do not meet."],
           ["mail_box", "Reach out when you are ready",
            "The study page carries the coordinator's own contact details. Nothing about you is sent until you send it."]
         ].each_with_index do |(icon, title, body), index| %>
        <li class="rounded-card border border-line dark:border-line-on-dark bg-surface dark:bg-surface-on-dark p-7 flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-11 h-11 rounded-control bg-sky-50 dark:bg-navy-900/40 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <%= render Utilities::IconComponent.new(icon, size: 5) %>
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-ink-4 dark:text-ink-4-on-dark">
              Step <%= index + 1 %>
            </span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-primary text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark"><%= title %></h3>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark"><%= body %></p>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<%# What you can count on. Three promises, and all three are now true of the
    code. "Open studies only" was false until the registry was finally asked for
    a status: a search had been returning mostly completed trials. %>
<section id="what-you-can-count-on" class="border-b border-line dark:border-line-on-dark bg-surface dark:bg-surface-on-dark">
  <div class="<%= Layout::PageWidth::CONTAINER %> py-16 lg:py-20 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px] lg:gap-16 items-center">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">What you can count on</p>
        <h2 class="font-primary text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark">
          Built for patients, not for sponsors
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <% [
             ["guage", "Every matching study, ranked the same way",
              "Results are ordered by how well you match, never by who is paying. A study cannot buy a position."],
             ["shield_check", "Your health details stay yours",
              "Nothing reaches a study team through this app. You contact the study yourself, when you decide to."],
             ["badge_check", "Open studies only",
              "We ask the registry for studies that are recruiting, opening soon, or enrolling by invitation. A study that closes stops appearing."]
           ].each do |icon, title, body| %>
          <div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <span class="w-10 h-10 shrink-0 rounded-control bg-sky-50 dark:bg-navy-900/40 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300 flex items-center justify-center">
              <%= render Utilities::IconComponent.new(icon, size: 5) %>
            </span>
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
              <h3 class="font-primary text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark"><%= title %></h3>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark"><%= body %></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%# The board fills this half with three photographs. Until there are
        licensed ones, the brand's own shapes hold the space rather than a grey
        frame or a stock photograph of somebody who is not a patient here. %>
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="hidden lg:block relative h-[360px] rounded-panel overflow-hidden
                                   bg-[linear-gradient(160deg,#EDF2FB_0%,#F6F9FD_60%,#FFFFFF_100%)]
                                   dark:bg-none dark:bg-paper-on-dark border border-line dark:border-line-on-dark">
      <%= render "shared/panel_backdrop", id: "proof", view_box: "0 0 360 360",
            blob_x: 250, blob_y: 110, blob_r: 130,
            pill_y: 190, pill_w: 180, pill_h: 220,
            dots_x: 210, dots_y: 240, dot_x: 90, dot_y: 70 %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# Community Stories. Absent rather than empty while no consented quotes exist:
    the ten invented ones stopped being served in PR #136. %>
<% if @testimonials.any? %>
  <section id="stories" class="border-b border-line dark:border-line-on-dark bg-paper dark:bg-paper-on-dark">
    <div class="<%= Layout::PageWidth::CONTAINER %> py-16 lg:py-20 flex flex-col gap-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">Community stories</p>
        <h2 class="font-primary text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark">
          Why people joined a clinical trial
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <% @testimonials.each do |testimonial| %>
          <%= render Page::Cards::QuoteComponent.new(testimonial: testimonial) %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
<% end %>

<%# The FAQ, read from the same list the FAQ page renders. %>
<section id="faq" class="border-b border-line dark:border-line-on-dark bg-surface dark:bg-surface-on-dark">
  <div class="<%= Layout::PageWidth::CONTAINER %> py-16 lg:py-20 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[340px_1fr] lg:gap-16 items-start">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300">Questions</p>
      <h2 class="font-primary text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark">
        Frequently asked questions
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark">
        The ones people ask before joining a study.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-1">
        <%= render Buttons::ButtonComponent.new(path: faq_path, text: "Read the full FAQ", color: "secondary") %>
        <%= render Buttons::ButtonComponent.new(path: contact_path, text: "Ask us", color: "quiet") %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col max-w-3xl">
      <% @faq_entries.each_with_index do |entry, index| %>
        <details class="border-t border-line dark:border-line-on-dark py-5 group" <%= "open" if index.zero? %>>
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none flex items-start gap-3 text-base font-bold
                          text-ink dark:text-ink-on-dark rounded-nav
                          focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-focus">
            <span class="text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark shrink-0 mt-0.5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180">
              <%= render Utilities::IconComponent.new("chevron_down", size: 5) %>
            </span>
            <span><%= entry.question %></span>
          </summary>
          <p class="pl-8 pt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-3 dark:text-ink-3-on-dark"><%= entry.answer %></p>
        </details>
      <% end %>
      <div class="border-t border-line dark:border-line-on-dark"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%# The closing call to action. The buttons are on-navy variants: `secondary` is
    navy text on a navy border, which on this panel is the same colour as the
    panel. Both buttons were invisible in light mode until PR #148. %>
<section id="get-started" class="bg-surface dark:bg-surface-on-dark">
  <div class="<%= Layout::PageWidth::CONTAINER %> py-16 lg:py-20">
    <div class="rounded-panel bg-navy-600 px-8 py-14 lg:py-20 flex flex-col items-center gap-5 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-primary max-w-3xl text-3xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
        Start with your condition
      </h2>
      <p class="max-w-xl text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed text-navy-100">
        Search without an account. Add a profile when you want to see how well each study fits you.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 pt-2">
        <%= render Buttons::ButtonComponent.new(path: search_index_path, text: "Search trials", color: "primary-on-navy") %>
        <%= render Buttons::ButtonComponent.new(
              path: new_user_registration_path, text: "Create a profile", color: "secondary-on-navy",
              icon: "arrow_right", icon_position: "right"
            ) %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
